[Poke:Infinite Lives]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$D13F(#N$D13F),#N$00</code>
</div>

Removes the instruction which would otherwise decrease #R$5BBA.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$D13C(#N$D13C)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#R$5BBA(#N$5BBA)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$D13F(#N$D13F)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC (#REGhl)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$D140(#N$D140)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JP M,#R$BA22(#N$BA22)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$D13C(#N$D13C)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#R$5BBA(#N$5BBA)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$D13F(#N$D13F)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$D140(#N$D140)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JP M,#R$BA22(#N$BA22)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
